abstract: "Estimated non-school property tax saved by homestead owners in each of Florida's 67 counties if Amendment 3 (2026 ballot, HJR 1F) passes, computed from every homestead parcel's assessed value on the Florida Department of Revenue 2026 preliminary roll (5,251,737 homesteads) and each county's 2025 non-school millage. Reports median assessed value, median and percentile savings for 2027 and 2028, the share of homesteads owing no non-school tax in 2028, and the county-wide reduction."
